ground tracking-tighter mb-2 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"tabular-nums\">0<!-- -->+</span></p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-theme-action uppercase tracking-widest\">Curated Guides</p></div><div class=\"flex-1 px-8 py-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center group\"><p class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-foreground tracking-tighter mb-2 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"tabular-nums\">0<!-- -->+</span></p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-theme-action uppercase tracking-widest\">Expert Authors</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 bg-theme-element border-y border-theme-accent/10\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center\"><div class=\"order-2 lg:order-1\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px);transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms;will-change:opacity, transform\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-theme-accent/20 bg-theme-element-sec group\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-theme-action/5 mix-blend-overlay group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-500 z-10\"></div><img alt=\"Workspace engineered for focus\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 600px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffocus_zone_about.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"order-1 lg:order-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px);transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms;will-change:opacity, transform\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-foreground tracking-tighter leading-tight mb-6\">Redefining the <br/> <span class=\"text-theme-action\">Learning Edge.</span></h2><p class=\"text-foreground/70 font-medium text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8\">The prevailing model of online education is flawed. Subscriptions trap you, notifications distract you, and infinite scrolling feeds paralyze you. We built this platform as an antidote. A space strictly reserved for high-signal, zero-noise engineering and design education.</p><ul class=\"space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 rounded-full bg-theme-action/10 p-1 text-theme-action shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-foreground/80 font-bold text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug\">No intrusive advertisements or paywalls.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 rounded-full bg-theme-action/10 p-1 text-theme-action shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-foreground/80 font-bold text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug\">Clean, readable typography on every device.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 rounded-full bg-theme-action/10 p-1 text-theme-action shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-foreground/80 font-bold text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug\">Community-vetted, expert-authored insights.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-32 bg-background\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms;will-change:opacity, transform\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16 md:mb-24\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-foreground tracking-tighter mb-4\">Our Core Values</h2><p class=\"text-foreground/70 font-medium text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">The unshakeable principles that guide everything we build, design, and write.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 auto-rows-[minmax(0,_1fr)]\"><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0ms;will-change:opacity, transform\"><div class=\"h-full p-8 rounded-3xl bg-theme-element-sec border border-theme-accent/20 hover:border-theme-action/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-background border border-theme-accent/15 flex items-center justify-center text-foreground mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:bg-theme-action group-hover:text-white group-hover:border-theme-action group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-300 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-black text-foreground tracking-tight mb-3\">Uncompromising Quality</h3><p class=\"text-foreground/70 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">Every article is rigorously reviewed. We prioritize depth, accuracy, and absolute clarity over sheer volume.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 50ms, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 50ms;will-change:opacity, transform\"><div class=\"h-full p-8 rounded-3xl bg-theme-element-sec border border-theme-accent/20 hover:border-theme-action/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-background border border-theme-accent/15 flex items-center justify-center text-foreground mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:bg-theme-action group-hover:text-white group-hover:border-theme-action group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-300 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-black text-foreground tracking-tight mb-3\">Zero Friction</h3><p class=\"text-foreground/70 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">No ads, no popups, no dark patterns. We designed a platform that respects your time and your attention.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 100ms, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 100ms;will-change:opacity, transform\"><div class=\"h-full p-8 rounded-3xl bg-theme-element-sec border border-theme-accent/20 hover:border-theme-action/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-background border border-theme-accent/15 flex items-center justify-center text-foreground mb-6 shadow-sm group-hover:bg-theme-action group-hover:text-white group-hover:border-theme-action group-hover:-rotate-3 transition-all duration-300 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-black text-foreground tracking-tight mb-3\">Elite Community</h3><p class=\"text-foreground/70 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">Surround yourself with driven peers. Growth accelerates when you immerse in a network of dedicated builders.</p></div></div><div class=\"h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opac